	KRHUB Teleport GUI  (LocalScript)
	Style reference: BlurAutoClicker (dark cards, green #06402B accent, OFF/ON switches)

	Tabs (top left):
	  Teleport - type a username / display name. A player card pops out with
	             TELEPORT, SPECTATE and ESP buttons for that person.
	  Friends  - your Roblox friends in the same server (TP / SPECTATE / ESP).
	  Misc     - ESP everyone, name tags, freecam, Anti-AFK, walk speed.
	  Tools    - noclip, fly (+ speed), click teleport.
	  VC       - voice chat button.

	Controls:
	  - Enter in the box teleports to the matched player
	  - Drag the title bar to move
	  - "-" minimizes, "x" hides it
	  - K toggles show/hide
	  - P toggles freecam (WASD, E/Q, hold right mouse to look)
	  - Slider value boxes are editable: type a number and press Enter
]]

